                                "sense_id": "20ac0ce1-3e99-34d1-910a-e6d522f06d41",
                                "text": "[…] a cot of iron had to be manufactured for [Bhim] after he had demolished two wooden cribs with a lusty kick of his foot; and a succession of bruised ayahs had finally to be replaced by a male attendant, a former Hastinapur all-in wrestling champion."
                            }
                        ]
